{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月10日，阿里巴巴公告稱，擬分拆全資子公司平頭哥（上海）技術股份有限公司赴香港聯交所主板獨立上市。香港聯交所已確認阿里巴巴可進行此次分拆，平頭哥已於2026年9月11日以保密形式向港交所遞交上市申請（A1表格）。此次分拆擬通過全球發售H股進行，包括香港公開發售及向機構和專業投資者配售。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585818.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.768801+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:39:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_hash":"cd7845d1c6ef9efdbc899d2fabe13fd22162946ffa823b583304d89bfa3d3c12","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}